1 NOTE {geni:about_me} {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000220021637888&size=large}}
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gyldenl%C3%B8ve#/media/File:Den_danske_Vitruvius_1_tab026_-_Kroner.jpg ''The Golden Lions (illegitimate children of the Danish King) had the right to bear an exclusive coronet'']
