2 CONT
2 CONT 18180. Mats Jonsen DALL-SVEGEN was born in 1565 in Sveio.(Svegen.)Finnås.Hordaland.Norway. He died about 1608 in Sveio.(Svegen.)Finnås.Hordaland.Norway. Mats married Alis Torsteinsdatter BØRØY. [Parents] 
2 CONT
2 CONT 18181. Alis Torsteinsdatter BØRØY was born Børøy.Bømlo.Hordaland.Norway in 1565. She died in Sveio.(Svegen.)Finnås.Hordaland.Norway. [Parents] 
2 CONT
