1 NAME Malene Gurine Larsdatter /Gåsland/
2 GIVN Malene Gurine Larsdatter
2 SURN Gåsland
2 _MARNM Halleraker
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 12 FEB 1880
2 PLAC Gåsland, Bømlo
