2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/57292944/danniel-h-johnson
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Johnson was born in Norway, but came to America when he was eight years old and settled in the town of Manchester, about eighteen years ago.
2 CONT He married to a lady at Ridgeway, Iowa a few years ago and it provided a very happy union.
2 CONT Several months ago he was ill with what appeared to be incipient consumption and some weeks since he removed to this city to be near medical assistance.
2 CONT The change was of no avail as he continued to fail until his death came on Sunday.
2 CONT He was a man possessed of so many good qualities as to endear him a large circle of friends, but the loss is not aline to them, it bit the entire community.
2 CONT The Enterprise bows in sorrow and extend our sympathy to the mourning friends and family.
2 CONT
2 CONT The funeral on Tuesday was very highly attended by friends in this city as well as many of his old neighbors from Manchester.
2 CONT The burial was at the West Norwegian Lutheran church cemetery in Manchester.
2 CONT Albert Lea Enterprise
2 CONT July 14,1892
