0 @N6000000007329706419@ NOTE Sophie Amalie (1628-85): dansk dronning; datter af hertug Georg af
1 CONT Braunschweig-Lüneburg (1582-1641). Gift 1643 på Glücksburg Slot med den
1 CONT senere kong Frederik 3. Efter dennes tronbestigelse 1648 kom Sophie i
1 CONT strid med Christian 4.s døtre og svigersønner, især Corfitz Ulfeldt og
1 CONT Leonora Christina, og fik skyld for sidstnævntes hårde fængselsophold.
1 CONT Øvede stor indflydelse ved enevældens indførelse. Begravet i Roskilde
1 CONT Domkirke.
0 @N6000000002322332164@ NOTE Historical facts of the time: In 1700, Johann Denner invented the Clarinet.
1 CONT In 1701, Captain Kidd was hanged for piracy. In 1702, England declared war on
1 CONT France and Spain, Queen Anne began war in America when the British attacked
1 CONT Saint Augustine in Florida, and the indians and French massacred British
1 CONT settlers in Deerfield, Mass.. Also in 1702, the first daily newspaper, The
1 CONT Daily Courant, was published in London.
