0 @N6000000006444529460@ NOTE Anne of Great Britain
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT
1 CONT Anne
1 CONT Queen of Great Britain and Ireland 
1 CONT British Royalty
1 CONT House of Stuart  
1 CONT
