0 @N6000000002322291560@ NOTE As elector, he, after the devastations of the Thirty Years' War, was able to
1 CONT restore the Hollenzollern dominions by centralizing the political
1 CONT administration, reorganizing the state finances, rebuilding towns and cities,
1 CONT developing a strong army, and acquiring sovereignty over ducal Prussia. All
1 CONT these measures contributed to the foundation of the future Prussian monarchy.
1 CONT To maintain the power balance in the region, he advanced the interests of his
1 CONT own house by always joining the weaker power against the stronger.
